

Rhaglen rheoli-cof: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Gwir.
>> a := Rhestr ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Gwrthrych newydd.
c ar: ['greet:'] gwneud: { Allbwn ysgrifennu: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Rhaglen tacluso.
>> usedMemory1 := (Rhaglen cof ? 0).




x := 1.
y := ['Hello'].
q := { ['']. }.
p := Gwir.
a := Rhestr ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 5.
c := Gwrthrych newydd.
c ar: ['greet:'] gwneud: { Allbwn ysgrifennu: ['greet!']. }.


Rhaglen tacluso.
>> usedMemory2 := (Rhaglen cof ? 0).




